              "end": 1,
              "start": 1
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Oral argument began at 11:06\u202fa.m. before the Supreme Court of the United States."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c25a732096714a4fc0fc7db2225f67e7426ab35201261b3d1d971f711b6da5ed",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c25a73209671-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts announced that the Court would hear argument in case\u202f06\u20116330,\u202fKimbrough\u202fv.\u202fUnited\u202fStates."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c25a732096714a4fc0fc7db2225f67e7426ab35201261b3d1d971f711b6da5ed",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c25a73209671-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether Congress could have mandated the result and the rationale that the Fourth Circuit used here."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c25a732096714a4fc0fc7db2225f67e7426ab35201261b3d1d971f711b6da5ed",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c25a73209671-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy further asked whether the district court must be able to disregard the commission\u2019s policy in every case that comes before it."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c25a732096714a4fc0fc7db2225f67e7426ab35201261b3d1d971f711b6da5ed",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c25a73209671-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Stevens, justice Stevens questioned whether the case might be controlled by *Neal v. United States*."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c25a732096714a4fc0fc7db2225f67e7426ab35201261b3d1d971f711b6da5ed",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c25a73209671-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked about the proportion of crack\u2011related sentences that are imposed at the mandatory minimum."
      }
    ],
